<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-Green Property H1 pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Green Property H1 pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			 (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.61		   vs 5.19</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.8		    vs 1.25</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    5.61		   vs 2.94</p>
<p> Net rents		  12.84		  vs 5.13</p>
<p> Operating profit	 12.09		  vs 4.66</p>
<p>NOTE - Green Property Plc said it made a profit of 0.95 million punts on the disposal of investment properties.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
